1
00:00:00,879 --> 00:00:03,049
(Leonard:)...because they would've
already wanted you...

2
00:00:03,214 --> 00:00:05,464
(Leonard:)...before they, you know, got you.

3
00:00:06,468 --> 00:00:09,218
(Sheldon:)From the mind that brought you hi-lo.

4
00:00:11,973 --> 00:00:13,393
(Sheldon:)Let me show you to your room.

5
00:00:13,558 --> 00:00:15,018
(Elizabeth:)All right, I guess I am tired.

6
00:00:15,185 --> 00:00:17,225
(Elizabeth:)-Good night, Leonard.
-Sleep night.

7
00:00:17,395 --> 00:00:19,105
(Leonard:)I mean, obviously, good night.

8
00:00:19,272 --> 00:00:22,482
(Leonard:)I started to say sleep tight.
Then I changed my mind in the middle.

9
00:00:22,650 --> 00:00:24,650
(Leonard:)I swear to God, I'm smart.

10
00:00:27,864 --> 00:00:29,114
(Sheldon:)Get it together, man.

11
00:00:32,243 --> 00:00:36,703
(Sheldon:)All right, let me show you
some of the features of the room.

12
00:00:36,873 --> 00:00:39,083
(Sheldon:)First, windows. Conventional.

13
00:00:39,250 --> 00:00:42,210
(Sheldon:)Open, closed. Open, closed.

14
00:00:42,795 --> 00:00:44,635
(Sheldon:)Halfway open, or halfway closed...

15
00:00:44,797 --> 00:00:47,587
(Sheldon:)...depending on
your philosophical bent.

16
00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:50,640
Over here is my comic-book collection.
Feel free to browse.

17
00:00:50,803 --> 00:00:54,803
(Sheldon:)There's a box of disposable
reading gloves on the nightstand.

18
00:00:55,475 --> 00:00:56,645
(Elizabeth:)Good to know.

19
00:00:56,851 --> 00:01:00,191
In here,
you'll find emergency provisions.

